## Terminology

TrainOnlyEngine, EnginePurpose, IdentityOverwritePolicy: `.cursor/rules/dl_toolbox_structure/dl_engine/exp_engine/train_only_engine/train_only_engine.mdc`.
ProjectLayout, TrackingBackend: `.cursor/rules/dl_toolbox_structure/project_layout/project_layout.mdc`.
TrainOnlyRun: `.cursor/rules/dl_toolbox_structure/dl_engine/runs/train_only_run.mdc`.
JSON: `.cursor/rules/dl_toolbox_structure/base/input_output/json_io.mdc`.
`devices_and_strategy`, `pick_visible_gpu_indices`: `.cursor/rules/dl_toolbox_structure/dl_engine/exp_engine/train_val_engine/default_layout.mdc`.

| Term | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `DefaultLayoutTrainOnlyEngine` | TrainOnlyEngine filled from ProjectLayout + recipes |
| `TrainOnlyRecipe` | parsed train-only JSON |
| `TrainOnlyFitParts` | `build_train_only` product: `net`, `loaders`, `steps`, `metrics`, `optimization` |
| `TrainOnlyEvalParts` | `build_eval` product: `loaders`, `evaluate_fn` |
| `DefaultLayoutTrainOnlyEngine.RESOLVED_CONFIG_FILENAME` | `"resolved_config.json"` (`RunLogConfig.filename`) |
| `DefaultLayoutTrainOnlyEngine.INSPECTION_STAGING_DIRNAME` | `"inspection_staging"` |
| `DefaultLayoutTrainOnlyEngine.INSPECTION_RUNS_DIRNAME` | `"inspection_runs"` |
| `DefaultLayoutTrainOnlyEngine.FIT_CONSTRUCTOR_KEYS` | `("force",)` |
| `DefaultLayoutTrainOnlyEngine.INSPECT_CONSTRUCTOR_KEYS` | `("inspect_recipe", "eval_device")` |
| `parse_train_only_recipe` | JSON object → `TrainOnlyRecipe` |

Train-recipe exact keys: `human_readable_name`, `run_group`, `seed`, `trainer`, `checkpoint_policy`, `early_stopping`, `logger`, `experiment_config`.

Inspect-recipe exact keys: `selector`, `evaluate` (the same inspect document DefaultLayoutTrainValEngine parses).

`trainer` exact keys are the fit-trainer document DefaultLayoutTrainValEngine already uses: `max_epochs`, `accelerator`, `devices`, `precision`, `enable_progress_bar`, `accumulate_grad_batches`.

